  "title": "Prompt Caching Slashes Input Costs Without Solving the Real Problem",
  "summary": "Prompt caching delivers a real 75–90% discount on cached input tokens across Anthropic, OpenAI, AWS Bedrock, and Google Gemini — but it never touches output tokens, which dominate spend at scale. Engineers who treat it as a cost solution are discounting a symptom while the actual line item keeps compounding.",
